WEBVTT

01:45.080 --> 01:46.140
Yingtao.

01:47.120 --> 01:47.960
Yingtao.

01:52.700 --> 01:53.860
Quick, get changed.

01:53.900 --> 01:54.880
Uncle Yu just called.

01:54.920 --> 01:57.120
He's taking us to
that breakfast spot by the gate.

01:58.440 --> 01:59.780
Breakfast?

02:02.660 --> 02:03.560
The baozi are here。

02:03.600 --> 02:05.080
- Come on.
- Oky.

02:05.120 --> 02:06.240
Okay.

02:06.280 --> 02:07.200
Okay. Thanks.

02:09.000 --> 02:09.900
Yingtao.

02:09.940 --> 02:11.540
Try this baozi.

02:11.580 --> 02:12.460
Here you are.

02:12.500 --> 02:14.260
Tastes exactly like the ones
we had in Qunshan.

02:14.300 --> 02:15.980
Exactly the same. Nothing changed.

02:19.620 --> 02:20.700
Is it good?

02:20.740 --> 02:22.000
How about it?

02:22.040 --> 02:22.880
Delicious.

02:23.540 --> 02:24.940
Look at our Yingtao,

02:25.460 --> 02:27.220
as adorable as when she was little,

02:27.260 --> 02:28.780
making everyone dote on her.

02:30.140 --> 02:32.200
No wonder people think

02:32.240 --> 02:34.280
she's dating someone.

02:36.240 --> 02:38.040
Back when our Cai Fangyuan

02:38.080 --> 02:39.640
was a first-grader

02:39.680 --> 02:41.120
getting bullied by older kids,

02:41.680 --> 02:42.700
it was little Yingtao

02:42.740 --> 02:44.980
who stormed into their classroom
to defend him.

02:45.520 --> 02:46.900
That's when I knew

02:46.940 --> 02:48.940
our boy was blessed.

02:49.600 --> 02:50.560
That feisty girl,

02:50.600 --> 02:51.440
she had to be sweet

02:51.480 --> 02:52.760
on him.

02:53.320 --> 02:54.160
Mom!

02:54.200 --> 02:56.260
Sister Kang, are you overthinking?

02:56.300 --> 02:57.700
Our Du Shang gets her

02:57.740 --> 02:59.120
justice service too.

02:59.620 --> 03:01.520
No wonder Sister Kang reads into things.

03:01.560 --> 03:03.480
Back when we first moved to Qunshan,

03:03.520 --> 03:05.220
it was Yingtao who dragged

03:05.260 --> 03:06.180
our Yu Qiao

03:06.220 --> 03:08.080
to class every day,

03:08.120 --> 03:09.840
showed him around.

03:09.880 --> 03:11.700
I never thought

03:11.740 --> 03:13.200
she'd fancy him.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.800
But he sure adored her.

03:14.840 --> 03:16.200
Mom, what are you saying?

03:16.240 --> 03:17.220
Who among you

03:17.260 --> 03:18.340
doesn't like Yingtao?

03:18.380 --> 03:19.340
What your mom means is,

03:19.380 --> 03:20.940
The connection between you all

03:20.980 --> 03:23.060
are good friendship.

03:23.100 --> 03:24.660
- Right.
- As childhood buddies.

03:24.700 --> 03:25.980
We, as parents, get it.

03:26.020 --> 03:28.480
Yeah, it's got nothing to do with

03:28.520 --> 03:29.360
puppy love.

03:29.880 --> 03:30.900
Forget all that

03:30.940 --> 03:32.360
puppy love nonsense.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.900
Let's not even talk about the other kids.

03:33.940 --> 03:35.480
But Yingtao, she'd never date young.

03:35.520 --> 03:36.420
Right.

03:36.460 --> 03:37.320
If anyone can

03:37.360 --> 03:38.900
prove otherwise,

03:38.940 --> 03:40.560
I, Cai Wu, swear right now:

03:40.600 --> 03:42.040
I'll buy the entire headquarter

03:42.080 --> 03:43.280
breakfast for a month.

03:43.320 --> 03:45.100
Li, you're my witness.

03:45.140 --> 03:46.720
Manager Cai, duly noted.

03:46.760 --> 03:48.020
I'll spread the words.

03:48.060 --> 03:49.020
That's won't be necessary.

03:49.060 --> 03:50.720
Let's leave it here.

03:50.760 --> 03:51.860
Consider this matter dropped

03:52.400 --> 03:53.480
and forget about

03:53.520 --> 03:54.360
that breakfast bet.

03:54.400 --> 03:55.860
Today's breakfast is

03:55.900 --> 03:57.020
my treat, everyone.

03:57.060 --> 03:58.420
It's on me.

03:58.460 --> 04:00.440
- Four more, please.
- Sure.

04:00.480 --> 04:01.980
- More baozi.
- Okay.

04:03.620 --> 04:04.680
Eat baozi.

04:04.720 --> 04:06.300
- Eat baozi, everyone.
- Delicious.

04:06.340 --> 04:07.180
Eat the egg.

04:07.220 --> 04:08.280
I peel it for you.

04:08.320 --> 04:09.160
No need.

04:09.200 --> 04:10.540
I peel it by myself.

04:11.760 --> 04:13.620
That breakfast was awesome.

04:13.660 --> 04:14.600
I took four fried dough twists,

04:14.640 --> 04:15.740
and Mom didn't scold me.

04:16.279 --> 04:18.760
With Uncle Li around,
no one would spread nonsense rumors.

04:20.360 --> 04:21.700
Listening to them,

04:21.740 --> 04:22.720
it hits me how much

04:22.760 --> 04:25.220
of our childhood survival
depended on Yingtao's blessings.

04:25.260 --> 04:26.320
Damn right!

04:26.360 --> 04:27.580
We better remember that.

04:30.780 --> 04:32.040
What's still worrying you?

04:33.240 --> 04:35.440
Don't you find it strange?

04:35.480 --> 04:36.760
Why is it?

04:36.800 --> 04:37.700
Jiang Qiaoxi's mom

04:37.740 --> 04:39.500
was supposed to be
on a business trip to Laishui.

04:40.200 --> 04:41.680
How did she suddenly show up?

04:41.720 --> 04:43.440
Even if she did come back early,
there's no way

04:43.480 --> 04:44.840
Jiang Qiaoxi would've told her

04:44.880 --> 04:45.860
he was meeting me.

04:46.880 --> 04:48.080
So how did she know?

04:49.540 --> 04:50.380
I know.

04:51.340 --> 04:52.180
We've got a mole.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.200
Not me.

05:01.320 --> 05:02.920
What're you staring at?

05:02.960 --> 05:03.820
Do you think it's me?

05:04.700 --> 05:06.120
- It hurts.
- Be gentle.

05:06.660 --> 05:07.500
Stop.

05:10.420 --> 05:12.480
That leaves only

05:12.520 --> 05:13.420
Qin Yeyun?

05:24.060 --> 05:25.140
Why're you being so loud?

05:25.180 --> 05:26.020
I…

05:27.120 --> 05:28.480
Is it my fault?

05:40.760 --> 05:42.000
Yingtao.

05:42.580 --> 05:43.420
Come here.

05:47.840 --> 05:49.700
Not a mole. It is an outsider.

05:51.160 --> 05:52.000
How do you know?

05:52.040 --> 05:53.200
That test paper

05:53.240 --> 05:55.420
with our meeting details is gone.

05:56.240 --> 05:57.380
I think

05:57.420 --> 05:58.420
someone took it.

06:02.760 --> 06:03.620
Who do you suspect?

06:06.480 --> 06:07.340
Fei Linge.

06:08.640 --> 06:10.420
He cares about Jiang Qiaoxi
more than anyone.

06:10.460 --> 06:11.720
He's also the one took the letter

06:11.760 --> 06:12.660
you wrote before.

06:17.240 --> 06:18.920
You're saying

06:18.960 --> 06:19.800
he already knows

06:19.840 --> 06:20.800
I'm Lin Yingtao?

06:22.780 --> 06:24.460
But why hasn't he done anything?

06:25.140 --> 06:26.260
Maybe he's planning

06:26.300 --> 06:27.440
something in the back.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.800
Here's the plan.

06:35.840 --> 06:36.880
First, we investigate.

06:36.920 --> 06:38.440
If it's really him,

06:38.480 --> 06:40.240
we settle all scores at once.

06:41.840 --> 06:42.840
Damn right we will.

06:53.440 --> 06:54.520
Have you noticed they

06:54.560 --> 06:55.580
have been giving us

06:55.620 --> 06:56.580
weird looks lately?

06:58.800 --> 07:00.040
What's wrong with them?

07:01.520 --> 07:02.360
Let's go.

07:03.520 --> 07:04.760
Wasn't Jiang Qiaoxi supposed to

07:04.800 --> 07:06.380
join the second training camp?

07:06.420 --> 07:07.900
Why did he leave for the first one

07:07.940 --> 07:09.580
so suddenly? Didn't even tell us.

07:10.720 --> 07:12.140
Xiaoman, do you know why?

07:12.720 --> 07:13.560
How should I know?

07:14.280 --> 07:15.320
Maybe Auntie Liang has

07:15.360 --> 07:16.840
some other plans for Jiang Qiaoxi.

07:16.880 --> 07:18.260
Jiang Qiaoxi is

07:18.300 --> 07:19.320
ghosting my calls.

07:19.360 --> 07:21.080
I was counting on him
for some exam questions.

07:25.060 --> 07:25.900
Go.

07:27.220 --> 07:28.220
- What're you doing?
- I have something to ask him.

07:29.040 --> 07:30.080
- Where are you going?
- Let's go.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.620
Don't go with him, Fei Linge.

07:31.660 --> 07:32.500
I refuse.

07:33.640 --> 07:34.480
Listening to her now?

07:35.620 --> 07:38.320
Go. The teacher is waiting for you.

07:38.360 --> 07:39.720
- For me?
- Yes.

07:44.420 --> 07:45.880
Start talking

07:46.900 --> 07:48.080
about everything you've done.

07:49.600 --> 07:51.420
And if your story doesn't add up…

07:54.500 --> 07:55.740
You gonna talk or what?

07:55.780 --> 07:57.160
Talk or not?

07:57.200 --> 07:58.740
Talk or not?

07:59.300 --> 08:02.160
Yingtao, you're going to beat him?

08:04.420 --> 08:05.620
That's called vibes.

08:06.480 --> 08:07.920
Is my vibe intimidating?

08:08.560 --> 08:09.580
Yes.

08:09.620 --> 08:10.740
Who's going to beat him?

08:27.620 --> 08:29.240
What's this? You've got the nerve

08:29.280 --> 08:30.980
to bully kids at Jialin Experimental?

08:31.020 --> 08:32.140
Don't twist the facts.

08:32.179 --> 08:33.320
You hit the floor by yourself.

08:33.360 --> 08:34.520
We didn't do anything.

08:38.620 --> 08:39.500
Well…

08:40.320 --> 08:41.760
You know why

08:41.799 --> 08:43.440
we called you here.

08:44.740 --> 08:45.940
Go ahead. Confess.

08:45.980 --> 08:47.500
What guilty things have you done to us?

08:49.120 --> 08:50.500
Me do something guilty?

08:50.540 --> 08:51.420
If anyone's guilty here,

08:51.460 --> 08:52.760
it's you.

08:55.640 --> 08:56.820
Then enlighten me

08:57.400 --> 08:59.200
what guilty deeds have we supposedly done?

09:00.860 --> 09:02.260
You know

09:02.300 --> 09:03.360
what you've done.

09:03.880 --> 09:05.600
Blame yourselves for being
so obvious about it.

09:07.180 --> 09:08.440
So it was you.

09:08.480 --> 09:09.380
Fei Linge.

09:10.020 --> 09:10.980
What are you doing?

09:11.960 --> 09:13.840
Xiaoman, go tell Ms. He

09:13.880 --> 09:15.060
that they're dating.

09:15.100 --> 09:16.360
I am not!

09:19.160 --> 09:20.280
You don't admit it, right?

09:20.320 --> 09:21.180
I have evidence.

09:21.900 --> 09:23.980
Jiang Qiaoxi and I are not dating.
Stop spreading lies.

09:24.020 --> 09:25.920
You think you could ever
date Jiang Qiaoxi?

09:27.240 --> 09:28.220
Dream on!

09:28.800 --> 09:29.800
Let's go.

09:37.880 --> 09:39.660
Alright, spill it.

09:39.700 --> 09:40.840
When did you two start dating?

09:41.780 --> 09:43.820
Since when are we dating?

09:44.460 --> 09:46.860
Since when did we ever start?

09:46.900 --> 09:49.020
Nobody even told us we were dating.

09:52.160 --> 09:53.080
You two still have

09:54.100 --> 09:55.300
the nerve to laugh about this?

09:56.100 --> 09:58.460
Ms. He, they're showing

09:58.500 --> 09:59.520
zero remorse.

10:01.560 --> 10:03.100
Enough. No more discussion.

10:03.140 --> 10:04.320
You two,

10:04.360 --> 10:05.680
call your parents. Now.

10:07.520 --> 10:09.820
Ms. He, we apologize for the trouble.

10:10.320 --> 10:12.380
For the record, we parents were aware of

10:12.420 --> 10:13.960
their aquarium trip.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.640
We even paid for the tickets ourselves.

10:18.260 --> 10:19.100
How can you parents

10:19.140 --> 10:20.460
still be smiling about this?

10:22.240 --> 10:24.060
At their age,

10:24.100 --> 10:25.660
going out so brazenly.

10:26.320 --> 10:27.200
Look at their behavior.

10:28.040 --> 10:29.300
This…

10:30.920 --> 10:31.800
This action?

10:33.360 --> 10:34.280
Ms. He,

10:35.100 --> 10:36.620
it's nothing.

10:37.240 --> 10:39.340
Just some head-patting.

10:39.380 --> 10:40.720
Their daughter even

10:40.760 --> 10:41.940
spanked our Yu Qiao's butt

10:41.980 --> 10:43.060
when they were toddlers.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.360
I mean,

10:46.020 --> 10:46.960
these two children

10:47.000 --> 10:48.880
grow up together.

10:48.920 --> 10:51.020
It's not a big deal to pat on the head.

10:51.880 --> 10:53.200
We're both employees
of Electric Power Construction,

10:53.240 --> 10:54.260
and these two children

10:54.300 --> 10:55.940
have grown up together

10:55.980 --> 10:57.960
as if they were brother and sister,

10:58.520 --> 10:59.880
so there's no problem,

10:59.920 --> 11:00.980
and you can rest assured.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.140
However,

11:03.180 --> 11:04.380
even in this case,

11:04.420 --> 11:06.540
you as parents still need to be careful.

11:06.580 --> 11:07.580
They are in puberty.

11:07.620 --> 11:08.700
They need to know

11:08.740 --> 11:10.280
differences between boys and girls

11:10.320 --> 11:11.580
Don't let it affect their studies.

11:11.620 --> 11:12.860
True.

11:12.900 --> 11:14.320
You were right.

11:14.360 --> 11:16.460
Yes, Ms. He, we parents

11:16.500 --> 11:17.340
- are watching them.
- Fei Linge.

11:17.380 --> 11:19.040
Nothing will happen.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.760
These photos are really well-shot,

11:20.800 --> 11:21.800
great composition too.

11:22.520 --> 11:24.500
- Mind giving them to us?
- Pardon?

11:25.480 --> 11:26.320
He says

11:27.380 --> 11:28.660
nice shots,

11:28.700 --> 11:30.320
good composition. He wants them.

11:37.640 --> 11:38.480
Yu Qiao,

11:39.460 --> 11:40.900
so you and Lin Qile

11:40.940 --> 11:42.380
aren't actually a thing?

11:46.160 --> 11:47.160
No wonder you've all

11:47.200 --> 11:48.640
been giving us those looks.

11:50.020 --> 11:51.080
Fei Linge's been

11:51.120 --> 11:52.300
poisoning your minds.

11:59.760 --> 12:02.200
Did the teacher give you any trouble?

12:02.860 --> 12:04.360
Do you need me to vouch for you?

12:05.320 --> 12:06.740
Don't worry.

12:07.240 --> 12:09.240
These rumors are disgusting,

12:10.900 --> 12:13.040
and I will set things straight.

12:13.700 --> 12:15.140
I'll have a serious talk with Fei Linge.

12:16.180 --> 12:17.380
No need, Monitor.

12:17.420 --> 12:18.700
Just a misunderstanding.

12:18.740 --> 12:19.920
I don't hold grudges
against small-minded people.

12:25.960 --> 12:26.800
Ling Qile.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.520
Has anyone ever told you

12:30.020 --> 12:31.340
what an amazing girl you are?

12:36.660 --> 12:37.680
Thank you, Monitor.

12:38.300 --> 12:40.380
I know about this.

12:50.480 --> 12:52.080
Stop whispering.

12:52.120 --> 12:52.960
Focus on your studys.

13:01.000 --> 13:01.840
Yu Qiao.

13:03.160 --> 13:04.420
Mom?

13:04.460 --> 13:05.540
Hello, Auntie.

13:05.580 --> 13:06.420
Listen, Yingtao's

13:06.960 --> 13:09.020
like a little sister
you've watched grow up.

13:09.060 --> 13:10.780
She just transferred schools,

13:10.820 --> 13:12.220
so you better look after her,

13:12.260 --> 13:13.200
understand?

13:13.760 --> 13:15.340
And ignore the gossip.

13:15.380 --> 13:16.600
There's no way you two

13:16.640 --> 13:17.680
are dating.

13:20.100 --> 13:21.000
Mom!

13:23.100 --> 13:23.940
Yingtao,

13:24.580 --> 13:26.760
don't be shy.

13:26.800 --> 13:28.260
No, I don't.

13:28.300 --> 13:29.760
We're just happy you kids

13:29.800 --> 13:31.200
get along so well.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.600
- It warms our hearts.
- Mom!

13:32.640 --> 13:34.020
- Don't be shy.
- Stop.

13:35.060 --> 13:36.520
She is the Yingtao?

13:37.980 --> 13:39.080
Come on.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.160
Go back, mom.

13:41.120 --> 13:41.960
It's okay.

13:42.500 --> 13:44.820
I want them to understand

13:44.860 --> 13:46.000
to stop that dating nonsense.

13:46.040 --> 13:48.200
Spreading that rumors

13:48.240 --> 13:49.400
is just terrible.

13:51.700 --> 13:52.540
What to do?

13:58.300 --> 13:59.840
I didn't tell you earlier
because I'm afraid

13:59.880 --> 14:01.040
Jiang Qiaoxi would get angry.

14:01.540 --> 14:02.700
How do you know?

14:02.740 --> 14:03.820
Let's skip that question.

14:08.120 --> 14:10.060
I've got something important to give you.

14:11.020 --> 14:13.100
She hid it so well.

14:15.680 --> 14:16.660
So Yu Qiao was covering

14:16.700 --> 14:18.520
for her back then.

14:21.360 --> 14:22.240
No wonder Jiang Qiaoxi's

14:22.280 --> 14:23.480
been avoiding school lately.

14:23.520 --> 14:24.360
Scared straight by her.

14:25.560 --> 14:26.400
Didn't Jiang Qiaoxi

14:26.440 --> 14:27.840
claim he didn't know her?

14:27.880 --> 14:29.400
That rejection was beyond obvious.

14:29.440 --> 14:31.360
He was just sparing her dignity.

14:31.400 --> 14:33.880
But she even transferred to our school.

14:33.920 --> 14:35.180
Surely a bold girl.

14:35.880 --> 14:38.620
Exactly! And somehow

14:38.660 --> 14:40.140
she still hid her identity.

14:40.180 --> 14:41.360
Your careless talks

14:41.400 --> 14:43.020
hurts people.

14:43.060 --> 14:43.900
Now hand it over.

14:43.940 --> 14:44.960
Monitor.

14:45.000 --> 14:46.160
Why are you defending her?

14:46.200 --> 14:47.220
They're ruining

14:47.260 --> 14:48.240
our class's reputation.

14:49.320 --> 14:50.500
There's a misunderstanding.

14:50.540 --> 14:51.380
Yingtao.

14:51.420 --> 14:52.700
You don't know her.

14:53.820 --> 14:56.040
I'm stuck on a Chinese question.

14:56.080 --> 14:57.100
Mind helping me?

14:57.140 --> 14:58.720
Come in, Yingtao.

14:58.760 --> 14:59.720
No need to stand there.

15:01.280 --> 15:02.120
Yingtao.

15:14.140 --> 15:15.540
Jiang Qiaoxi hasn't even said anything.

15:15.580 --> 15:17.160
Why are you all spouting nonsense?

15:18.500 --> 15:19.780
That paper with meeting details

15:19.820 --> 15:21.060
between you and Jiang Qiaoxi,

15:21.680 --> 15:22.820
are in their hands.

15:22.860 --> 15:24.080
- My paper?
- Yes.

15:24.120 --> 15:25.220
They've known that

15:25.260 --> 15:26.200
Qile is Yingtao.

15:27.520 --> 15:28.360
Yu Qiao.

15:29.580 --> 15:31.040
Yu Qiao, what are you doing?

15:31.080 --> 15:32.340
- What are you doing?
- Give it back.

15:32.380 --> 15:33.760
My test paper is in your hand.

15:33.800 --> 15:34.800
What? Did you steal it?

15:35.680 --> 15:38.040
How is it your test paper?
Prove it's yours.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.360
It's got my name on it.

15:39.400 --> 15:40.520
You think everyone's like

15:40.560 --> 15:41.500
that Yingtao,

15:41.540 --> 15:42.600
fancy shady stuff?

15:42.640 --> 15:43.660
I put my paper in my drawer.

15:43.700 --> 15:44.960
You mean it was blown out?

17:16.560 --> 17:17.760
You walk home with us today.

17:17.800 --> 17:18.960
What's the occasion?

17:20.400 --> 17:22.780
Since someone is having problems,

17:22.819 --> 17:24.560
I must take advantage of the situation.

17:28.359 --> 17:29.200
Do you think

17:29.240 --> 17:30.080
I'm afraid?

17:31.000 --> 17:31.900
In this school,

17:31.940 --> 17:32.780
at least

17:33.820 --> 17:34.900
five people

17:34.940 --> 17:36.000
believe in me

17:36.040 --> 17:37.000
and stand by my side.

17:38.360 --> 17:39.480
I don't think anyone else could

17:39.520 --> 17:40.860
handle what I've been through

17:41.480 --> 17:42.440
as well as I have.

17:44.060 --> 17:45.540
You've beaten Yu Qiao and say out loud

17:45.580 --> 17:46.660
the punch lines of Hong Kong

17:46.700 --> 17:47.540
movie protagonists.

17:49.020 --> 17:51.320
Since you've figured it out,
then lighten up a little.

17:55.940 --> 17:57.280
It's Saturday tomorrow.

17:57.320 --> 17:59.160
Anyone free to come with me

18:00.800 --> 18:01.780
to the Olympiad training?

18:02.960 --> 18:03.800
No, I'm not.

18:05.140 --> 18:06.840
I'll go with my dad to restock inventory.

18:07.560 --> 18:08.720
Yingtao, I gotta go with my mom

18:08.760 --> 18:10.340
to my grandma's place tomorrow.

18:11.840 --> 18:13.020
- Tomorrow, I…
- You, Cai Fangyuan.

18:14.060 --> 18:16.060
You have to go with me tomorrow.

18:16.100 --> 18:18.060
You've been there before.
You know the way.

18:18.720 --> 18:19.560
My only option.

18:21.800 --> 18:24.180
It's tough doing this all by myself.

18:27.880 --> 18:28.720
Yu Qiao.

18:33.540 --> 18:34.580
Don't look at me.

18:34.620 --> 18:35.740
I'm not going.

18:38.060 --> 18:38.900
You…

18:42.040 --> 18:43.040
Lin Yingtao, you…

18:46.200 --> 18:47.360
Stop right there!

18:47.400 --> 18:49.500
The class should be over around this time.

18:49.540 --> 18:51.300
Jiang Qiaoxi usually
goes for snacks in the cafe.

18:51.340 --> 18:52.220
You guys can head

18:52.260 --> 18:53.500
straight there to find him.

18:53.540 --> 18:54.480
Back when I was training here,

18:54.520 --> 18:56.000
I got too familiar with all the teachers.

18:56.040 --> 18:56.940
I'd be recognized right away.

18:56.980 --> 18:58.500
So I'll stay outside and
watch for you two.

19:02.660 --> 19:03.500
Senior Jiang,

19:04.580 --> 19:05.460
is this seat taken?

19:06.540 --> 19:07.380
No, please.

19:07.420 --> 19:08.260
All right.

19:10.900 --> 19:11.900
Senior Jiang,

19:12.460 --> 19:14.820
the legendary genius,
I've heard so much about you.

19:16.600 --> 19:18.020
I heard you were set for the next term.

19:18.060 --> 19:19.300
Didn't expect you

19:19.340 --> 19:20.400
to join us now.

19:20.440 --> 19:21.720
I'm so lucky.

19:23.440 --> 19:24.280
Thank you.

19:25.020 --> 19:26.100
Senior Jiang,

19:26.140 --> 19:27.740
did you join us so suddenly

19:27.780 --> 19:29.140
to avoid that girl from Qunshan?

19:31.020 --> 19:32.080
What?

19:32.120 --> 19:33.640
My friend from Jialin Experimental

19:33.680 --> 19:34.840
just called me.

19:34.880 --> 19:36.820
Apparently, your school's forum is buzzing

19:36.860 --> 19:38.640
about that Qunshan Girl.

19:38.680 --> 19:39.800
Rumor has it she transferred

19:39.840 --> 19:41.920
to your school just to chase after you,

19:41.960 --> 19:43.980
even hid her background from everyone.

19:44.760 --> 19:46.740
Also, she even asked you
to come out at midnight…

19:53.240 --> 19:54.560
Cai Fangyuan said we should

19:54.600 --> 19:56.440
turn left first after going in, right?

19:56.480 --> 19:57.540
Yes. Turn left.

19:59.680 --> 20:00.820
- You two!
- Oh, no.

20:00.860 --> 20:01.740
Stand right there!

20:01.780 --> 20:03.320
We saw you earlier.

20:03.360 --> 20:04.800
- Stop!
- Run!

20:04.840 --> 20:05.680
- Li and Zhao, go for them.
- Stop!

20:05.720 --> 20:07.000
- I'm here!
- Stop!

20:07.040 --> 20:08.600
Go easy on them. They're students.

20:09.340 --> 20:10.680
Stop, you!

20:11.600 --> 20:13.400
Our school cafeteria food
not good enough for you?

20:13.440 --> 20:14.820
Every day there's always

20:14.860 --> 20:16.000
students like you

20:16.040 --> 20:17.940
rushing out to feast on junk foods.

20:17.980 --> 20:19.360
Come with me to the security office.

20:19.400 --> 20:21.240
- Let's have your teacher come collect you.
- Stop!

20:22.160 --> 20:23.060
Stop running.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.400
Mr.

20:25.440 --> 20:26.280
Tell them to stop.

20:26.320 --> 20:27.360
We're not…

20:27.900 --> 20:29.120
- Stop arguing and just go.
- Come back!

20:49.220 --> 20:50.220
I…

20:53.000 --> 20:55.180
I'm here to find my rabbit.

20:55.220 --> 20:56.260
Your rabbit?

20:58.960 --> 20:59.920
My rabbit

20:59.960 --> 21:01.440
accidentally slipped in

21:01.480 --> 21:03.160
through your school gate.

21:03.200 --> 21:04.580
I've come to look for it.

21:04.620 --> 21:06.440
This rabbit is extremely

21:06.480 --> 21:07.320
important to me.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.820
If you happen to see my rabbit,

21:09.860 --> 21:11.360
please tell it that

21:12.060 --> 21:13.000
don't worry about me.

21:13.700 --> 21:14.960
No matter what happens,

21:15.000 --> 21:16.400
I can handle it.

21:16.980 --> 21:19.300
You silly kid, what are you thinking?

21:19.340 --> 21:21.320
How could a rabbit
possibly worry about you?

21:21.360 --> 21:22.400
It's…

21:22.440 --> 21:24.020
My rabbit does worry about me.

21:26.620 --> 21:27.720
Classmate,

21:28.540 --> 21:30.060
if you see my bunny,

21:31.300 --> 21:32.300
please tell it that.

21:32.800 --> 21:34.000
Sure.

21:34.040 --> 21:35.040
Jiang Qiaoxi,

21:35.080 --> 21:36.780
what are you doing here?

21:36.820 --> 21:37.660
Mr.

21:37.700 --> 21:39.840
I came out to look for my missing cat.

21:39.880 --> 21:40.860
I can't find it anywhere.

21:40.900 --> 21:41.940
Your cat?

21:42.560 --> 21:44.440
Yes. It's the most

21:45.000 --> 21:46.500
adorable little cat,

21:46.540 --> 21:49.020
snow-white fur

21:49.060 --> 21:51.860
with a cherry-red

21:52.600 --> 21:53.600
nose.

21:54.920 --> 21:55.900
Have you seen it?

21:57.920 --> 22:00.140
Haven't seen it. No cats spotted

22:00.180 --> 22:01.080
in our training camp.

22:01.120 --> 22:02.240
Actually,

22:02.280 --> 22:03.800
there is a little cat in our camp.

22:04.600 --> 22:05.580
Maybe the bad weather,

22:05.620 --> 22:06.840
the constant raining,

22:06.880 --> 22:08.300
made my kitten

22:08.820 --> 22:09.860
hide itself.

22:21.740 --> 22:24.400
I was really worried about her at first.

22:25.260 --> 22:27.780
I am worried that she'd struggle.

22:28.780 --> 22:30.200
Others might mistreat her.

22:30.960 --> 22:31.800
But…

22:32.480 --> 22:33.540
But now I know:

22:34.040 --> 22:35.260
she's the toughest,

22:35.800 --> 22:36.780
bravest little cat.

22:37.600 --> 22:39.540
She'll be comfortably

22:39.580 --> 22:41.400
nap in sunlight,

22:41.440 --> 22:42.440
watch sunsets with breeze.

22:43.340 --> 22:44.640
Even without me,

22:46.160 --> 22:48.040
she'll thrive.

22:49.060 --> 22:50.580
Because she's the most

22:51.120 --> 22:51.960
extraordinary cat.

22:59.920 --> 23:01.120
I get it now.

23:01.160 --> 23:02.260
You've all been

23:02.300 --> 23:04.020
under too much pressure lately.

23:05.060 --> 23:07.240
Mr, I forgot to mention earlier.

23:07.280 --> 23:08.120
She's actually

23:08.620 --> 23:10.020
a classmate from our school.

23:10.640 --> 23:12.040
She might have come to visit us.

23:12.080 --> 23:14.160
Would it be possible for me to…

23:14.200 --> 23:15.640
Then you should have informed them

23:15.680 --> 23:17.020
that visitors aren't allowed here.

23:17.740 --> 23:19.520
Alright, it's getting late.

23:19.560 --> 23:21.280
Qiaoxi, you go rest.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.060
I'll escort them out.

23:24.260 --> 23:25.200
- Go.
- Sure.

23:28.680 --> 23:31.060
I'm fine, really. Go on back now.

23:31.800 --> 23:32.640
Take care of yourself.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.480
Rest assured.

23:49.020 --> 23:51.220
Whether youth was smoke
or a wish fulfilled,

23:51.260 --> 23:56.180
all can be redeemed with laughter

23:56.220 --> 23:59.120
Who changed the years

24:00.300 --> 24:03.020
in just a blink?

24:03.060 --> 24:04.040
Cai Fangyuan!

24:04.080 --> 24:04.920
Cai Fangyuan!

24:06.080 --> 24:07.180
Cai Fangyuan.

24:07.960 --> 24:08.800
We…

24:10.000 --> 24:11.040
Shh, I am listening to music.

24:11.700 --> 24:13.020
This is the power of love.

24:13.700 --> 24:18.680
With all my innocence,

24:18.720 --> 24:21.980
I wrote this poem.

24:22.020 --> 24:26.280
If beauty fades too soon,

24:26.320 --> 24:30.380
remember that address

24:30.420 --> 24:35.540
where we remain unchanged,

24:35.580 --> 24:38.980
unafraid to disappear.

25:01.840 --> 25:02.680
Right here.

25:13.360 --> 25:15.980
How I wish to wake

25:16.020 --> 25:19.320
with dawn winds soothing every sorrow

25:20.460 --> 25:22.600
How I wish to turn

25:22.640 --> 25:26.600
and find your gaze could melt all frost

25:28.100 --> 25:30.720
How I wish to lift my eyes

25:30.760 --> 25:33.420
to see your smile tomorrow

25:33.460 --> 25:35.620
How I wish you'd

25:35.660 --> 25:39.680
share your joys and pains

25:41.160 --> 25:44.680
How I wish our family's hearts
could beat as one

25:44.720 --> 25:46.000
How I wish each journey

25:46.040 --> 25:48.280
warmed with kindness we'd designed

25:48.320 --> 25:49.720
How I wish the world

25:49.760 --> 25:51.800
returned your dreams when you let go

25:51.840 --> 25:53.200
How I wish you knew

25:53.240 --> 25:55.440
my love still flows

25:55.480 --> 25:58.920
Life must always face the light,

25:58.960 --> 26:02.660
Stumbling, yet standing upright

26:02.700 --> 26:05.040
Count the meteors on your sleeve

26:05.080 --> 26:09.760
I'm here, and never leave

26:09.800 --> 26:13.240
Life must always face the light

26:13.280 --> 26:16.980
Hope grows greater after night

26:17.020 --> 26:19.060
Where the darkness starts to thin

26:19.100 --> 26:25.320
Held-out happiness will bloom within

26:39.200 --> 26:41.820
How I wish to wake

26:41.860 --> 26:45.100
with dawn winds soothing every sorrow

26:46.300 --> 26:48.920
How I wish to turn

26:48.960 --> 26:52.200
and find your gaze could melt all frost

26:53.940 --> 26:56.560
How I wish to lift my eyes

26:56.600 --> 26:59.860
to see your smile tomorrow

26:59.900 --> 27:01.120
How I wish you'd

27:01.160 --> 27:05.240
share your joys and pains

27:05.280 --> 27:06.560
If you dare associate with

27:06.600 --> 27:08.080
those people from Qunshan again,

27:09.400 --> 27:11.240
I have ways to make them leave.

27:11.280 --> 27:13.980
Stumbling, yet standing upright

27:14.020 --> 27:16.920
Count the meteors on your sleeve

27:16.960 --> 27:21.280
I'm here, and never leave

27:21.320 --> 27:24.760
Life must always face the light

27:24.800 --> 27:28.500
Hope grows greater after night

27:28.540 --> 27:30.580
Where the darkness starts to thin

27:30.620 --> 27:36.840
Held-out happiness will bloom within

27:45.060 --> 27:45.900
Yingtao.

27:46.600 --> 27:47.740
Will Jiang Qiaoxi

27:49.700 --> 27:51.680
ever know you're singing for him?

27:53.000 --> 27:53.840
Yes.

27:56.900 --> 27:57.760
He knows.

28:15.120 --> 28:15.960
Disband!

28:16.000 --> 28:17.520
- Good!
- Okay!

28:17.560 --> 28:19.020
One basketball game?

28:19.060 --> 28:20.640
- I need to put this back.
- Okay.

28:20.680 --> 28:21.520
Go.

28:24.780 --> 28:26.000
Come on, let's hit the court.

28:26.040 --> 28:26.940
Watch my game.

28:28.660 --> 28:29.960
I won't go with you.

28:30.480 --> 28:31.960
Monthly exams are coming up.
I'm heading back to study.

28:32.000 --> 28:35.260
Then let Cai Fangyuan go with you instead.

28:37.840 --> 28:40.800
He's busy with his grand ambitions.
I gotta go.

28:41.460 --> 28:42.560
Then I'll go back with you.

28:45.100 --> 28:46.800
No need to come back with me.

28:47.460 --> 28:49.440
Go play basketball like you wanted.

28:49.480 --> 28:51.080
It's not like I'll get eaten alive alone.

28:51.940 --> 28:54.180
Where is Yu Qiao? Let's go.

28:54.220 --> 28:55.760
Hurry up. Don't waste time.

28:55.800 --> 28:57.600
We need you to wipe the floor
for Class Six.

28:58.300 --> 28:59.500
Then I'll go?

29:00.060 --> 29:00.900
Off you go.

29:03.200 --> 29:04.040
Come on, Yu Qiao.

29:06.240 --> 29:08.360
- I was not expecting…
- I told her…

29:08.400 --> 29:10.620
You refused?

29:12.800 --> 29:14.280
I'm completely mind-blown.

29:50.420 --> 29:52.500
Lin Qile, I noticed
you struggling in class.

29:52.540 --> 29:54.160
Here's my physics notes.

29:55.080 --> 29:56.040
I just said,

29:56.080 --> 29:56.980
here are my notes.

29:57.020 --> 29:58.500
They're pretty thorough.

29:59.060 --> 30:00.340
If any problems, ask me.

30:01.560 --> 30:03.220
Our monitor is so helpful.

30:05.000 --> 30:05.840
Monitor,

30:05.880 --> 30:07.900
my chemistry's also a disaster.

30:07.940 --> 30:09.760
Mind if I ask you about that too?

30:11.800 --> 30:12.920
Of course.

30:12.960 --> 30:15.500
I'm not exactly a chemistry whiz either,

30:15.540 --> 30:17.540
but if you have any questions,

30:17.580 --> 30:18.420
feel free to ask me.

30:19.840 --> 30:22.480
Yeah, physics is definitely
our monitor's strong suit.

30:24.860 --> 30:25.780
Thank you.

30:26.320 --> 30:28.260
I will ask the teacher
if I have any questions.

31:16.740 --> 31:18.620
Ling Yingtao, you look dead tired.

31:18.660 --> 31:20.500
Robbed a bank last night?

31:20.540 --> 31:22.900
Does stealing light through
a chiseled hole count as burglary?

31:22.940 --> 31:24.280
You stay up late to study?

31:24.320 --> 31:25.400
Too diligent.

31:26.040 --> 31:27.260
Burning the night before exams?

31:27.300 --> 31:28.780
That's not diligence.

31:28.820 --> 31:30.520
That's just last-minute effort.

31:31.220 --> 31:33.460
Physics is brutal.

31:33.500 --> 31:34.340
I've memorized

31:34.380 --> 31:36.020
all the formulas,

31:36.060 --> 31:37.780
but when I actually try solving problems,

31:37.820 --> 31:39.980
I realize that's all I know,
just the formulas.

31:40.020 --> 31:41.120
Quickly!

31:41.160 --> 31:42.000
I'm coming.

31:43.260 --> 31:45.100
How does Jiang Qiaoxi know everything?

31:45.140 --> 31:46.280
Ling Yingtao.

31:46.320 --> 31:47.960
Don't sell yourself short.

31:48.000 --> 31:50.360
You earned your place
at Jialin Experimental

31:50.400 --> 31:52.400
from Qunshan No. 1 Middle School
purely on merit.

31:52.440 --> 31:53.960
And physics,

31:54.000 --> 31:56.000
once it clicks for you,
those problems aren't so hard.

31:56.040 --> 31:57.420
Maybe during today's exam,

31:57.460 --> 31:59.100
you will gain your third-eye power.

31:59.140 --> 32:00.100
Everything will make sense after.

32:01.920 --> 32:03.620
During the last physics quiz break,

32:03.660 --> 32:04.500
who was there to sing

32:04.540 --> 32:05.900
Nunchucks at me for ten minutes?

32:06.520 --> 32:07.500
When I took that test,

32:07.540 --> 32:08.380
I was stuck on that

32:08.420 --> 32:09.620
loop of "hu-hu-ha-hei".

32:10.520 --> 32:12.440
Relax. I promise no antics
this exam season.

32:12.940 --> 32:15.140
Besides, why compare yourself
to Jiang Qiaoxi?

32:15.180 --> 32:16.820
You outshine him in everything else.

32:17.560 --> 32:19.380
Even geniuses have their blind spots.

32:24.520 --> 32:25.700
Listen up, class.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.300
When it comes to math,

32:27.340 --> 32:29.040
formulas are everything.

32:29.080 --> 32:31.620
Memorize them accurately, drill them deep,

32:31.660 --> 32:33.500
burn them into your brains.

32:33.540 --> 32:34.680
Understood?

32:34.720 --> 32:36.700
Yes!

32:36.740 --> 32:38.500
Any questions about

32:38.540 --> 32:39.380
today's formulas?

32:39.960 --> 32:41.080
Raise your hand if any.

32:43.120 --> 32:44.240
Then raise your hand if you get it.

32:48.940 --> 32:50.980
Lin Qile, you've got it?

32:51.580 --> 32:52.420
Got it all?

32:53.740 --> 32:55.180
Come up here.

32:55.700 --> 32:57.220
Solve this problem.

32:57.260 --> 32:58.300
Get it wrong, and you'll be

32:58.340 --> 32:59.340
taking this lesson

32:59.380 --> 33:00.360
on your feet.

33:00.400 --> 33:01.400
Come here.

33:11.400 --> 33:12.700
Class, solve it on your notebook.

34:12.179 --> 34:15.139
Ms, is it right?

34:15.980 --> 34:18.920
Looks like the sun rose
from the west today.

34:18.960 --> 34:20.659
Our class average

34:20.699 --> 34:22.260
might actually improve for once.

34:22.300 --> 34:23.239
Not bad. Go back.

34:24.380 --> 34:25.520
Did everyone get these right?

34:25.560 --> 34:27.900
- Yes!
- Yes!

34:27.940 --> 34:28.780
All correct?

34:29.320 --> 34:30.420
Well done, everyone!

34:59.500 --> 35:00.560
Go.

35:00.600 --> 35:01.820
Have a look.

35:01.860 --> 35:03.040
Aren't you curious?

35:03.080 --> 35:04.440
How'd your English exam go?

35:04.480 --> 35:06.300
Monthly exam results are out.

35:06.340 --> 35:07.880
Check your scores.

35:08.900 --> 35:11.220
Stay humble in victory,
resilient in defeat.

35:59.780 --> 36:00.620
What are you doing?

36:05.940 --> 36:06.780
How was it?

36:06.820 --> 36:08.160
Did I

36:09.220 --> 36:10.340
do badly?

36:11.140 --> 36:12.160
Lin Yingtao,

36:12.980 --> 36:15.000
you are absolute legend.

36:15.040 --> 36:16.540
You ranked 5th in the whole class?

36:18.640 --> 36:19.960
Are you telling the truth?

36:20.000 --> 36:21.100
Why did I lie to you?

36:22.840 --> 36:23.880
I ranked 5th.

36:30.340 --> 36:31.180
I gonna go.

36:33.340 --> 36:35.140
You? What about you?

36:35.180 --> 36:36.340
No beatings for you at home?

36:36.380 --> 36:38.140
I…

36:38.180 --> 36:39.180
I ranked 3rd.

36:41.340 --> 36:42.300
You ranked 3rd?

36:43.340 --> 36:44.500
Since when did you get

36:44.540 --> 36:45.380
so good at exams?

36:47.460 --> 36:48.300
Dead last.

36:49.920 --> 36:50.760
Dead last?

36:52.520 --> 36:53.840
Then my 5th…

36:53.880 --> 36:55.520
You actually thought you'd rank high?

36:55.560 --> 36:56.680
Come on. We're both

36:56.720 --> 36:57.560
bottom-dwellers.

37:02.440 --> 37:04.580
You're just two spots
less pathetic than me.

37:05.460 --> 37:06.540
With scores like yours,

37:07.460 --> 37:08.300
my parents

37:08.340 --> 37:09.180
can't possibly

37:09.220 --> 37:10.480
be too hard on me.

37:12.080 --> 37:12.920
I will be hard on you.

37:12.960 --> 37:15.080
Cai Fangyuan! Why did you lie to me?

37:15.120 --> 37:16.900
Lin Yingtao, hold your fury.

37:17.520 --> 37:20.240
- Even Yu Qiao couldn't escape.
- What's wrong with him?

37:20.820 --> 37:23.700
He ranked 15th from the bottom.

37:24.820 --> 37:25.860
Even he bombed this hard?

37:35.860 --> 37:36.860
Just you wait.

37:39.400 --> 37:40.740
She managed to score high enough

37:40.780 --> 37:42.280
to get into our class before,

37:42.320 --> 37:44.360
it has to be luck.

37:44.400 --> 37:45.680
Exactly!

37:45.720 --> 37:47.700
Who could have good fortune all the time?

37:49.220 --> 37:50.260
Lin Qile spends all her time

37:50.300 --> 37:51.620
with those Qunshan kids.

37:51.660 --> 37:53.020
When exactly is she supposed to study?

37:53.060 --> 37:53.900
Right.

37:57.560 --> 37:58.400
Any cold water?

38:02.300 --> 38:04.220
If you're here to get water,
then get water.

38:04.260 --> 38:05.620
Stop the gossiping.

38:05.660 --> 38:06.640
None of your business.

38:08.720 --> 38:09.660
Yes.

38:09.700 --> 38:10.860
It's none of our business.

38:11.360 --> 38:12.640
None of us have

38:12.680 --> 38:13.860
half of Lin Qile's skills.

38:14.900 --> 38:16.200
First Jiang Qiaoxi,

38:16.240 --> 38:17.340
then Feng Letian,

38:17.380 --> 38:18.660
and now you.

38:18.700 --> 38:20.000
All of you are defending her?

38:20.040 --> 38:20.880
Exactly.

38:21.860 --> 38:22.940
I saw Cai Fangyuan

38:22.980 --> 38:24.240
fooling around with her

38:24.280 --> 38:25.360
on the field just now.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.680
You don't know this?

38:26.720 --> 38:29.280
Jia Sisi, keep it civil.

38:30.080 --> 38:31.580
- I'm uncivil?
- You say it again…

38:32.880 --> 38:33.780
What are you doing?

38:33.820 --> 38:35.600
How can you talk like that?

38:36.640 --> 38:37.700
- I will tell Ms.
- She's a girl.

38:37.740 --> 38:38.640
Why so harsh?

38:39.960 --> 38:41.120
He tried to hit me.

38:42.180 --> 38:43.020
Yu Qiao.

38:43.060 --> 38:44.360
You used to have such good grades.

38:44.400 --> 38:46.060
Hang around Lin Qile

38:46.100 --> 38:47.340
and suddenly you're this rank?

38:49.220 --> 38:50.640
- I didn't become this.
- He tried to hit me.

38:50.680 --> 38:51.780
I chose it.

38:51.820 --> 38:53.460
I want this ranking.

38:55.420 --> 38:56.880
We've played basketball for ages.

38:56.920 --> 38:57.900
Let me tell you.

38:57.940 --> 38:59.400
Lin Qile isn't someone to mess with.

39:00.320 --> 39:02.240
Let me tell you too.
Stop talking nonsense.

39:04.600 --> 39:05.620
This Lin Qile

39:05.660 --> 39:07.480
really does have some kind of magic.

39:07.520 --> 39:09.220
- Feng Letian treats her like royalty.
- Yu Qiao.

39:09.260 --> 39:12.580
- Yu Qiao tanks his grades for her.
- You did good before this year.

39:12.620 --> 39:15.500
- Jiang Qiaoxi asked her to fetch water.
- I haven't talked to you for the scores.

39:15.540 --> 39:17.020
I am not following this at all.

39:17.060 --> 39:18.460
- What's wrong with these guys?
- You're practically an adult.

39:18.500 --> 39:20.260
Still solve problems with fists?

39:20.980 --> 39:21.860
Are you not ashamed?

39:23.060 --> 39:23.900
Huang Zhanjie,

39:24.680 --> 39:25.620
words can cut deeper

39:25.660 --> 39:26.980
than fists.

39:27.020 --> 39:27.920
Ever thought about that?

39:28.500 --> 39:29.340
Ms. He.

39:30.140 --> 39:31.300
It's not just me saying this.

39:31.840 --> 39:32.720
Everyone's talking.

39:32.760 --> 39:33.760
Does everyone's words

39:33.800 --> 39:34.640
make it true?

39:36.340 --> 39:38.780
Don't blindly follow the crowd.

39:38.820 --> 39:40.220
If you want to know someone,

39:40.260 --> 39:42.140
you need to learn and understand.

39:42.680 --> 39:44.340
You can't define a person with hearsay.

39:47.220 --> 39:50.300
From now on,
if I catch anyone forming cliques

39:51.180 --> 39:52.340
and gossiping behind backs,

39:53.420 --> 39:54.860
Class 18 won't have them.

39:57.000 --> 39:58.600
Listen carefully.

39:58.640 --> 39:59.540
Wherever you go in life,

40:00.040 --> 40:02.100
you'll always be under
someone's gaze and judgment.

40:03.020 --> 40:04.560
The person you see from other's eyes

40:04.600 --> 40:05.820
isn't the real you.

40:05.860 --> 40:07.540
Even the person you see in your own eyes

40:07.580 --> 40:09.220
isn't the real you.

40:09.260 --> 40:10.740
But the way you see others

40:11.540 --> 40:12.520
is a truthful reflection

40:12.560 --> 40:13.540
of who you really are.

40:15.180 --> 40:16.940
Ms seems very angry.

40:16.980 --> 40:17.880
Let's go.

40:25.480 --> 40:27.040
Lin Qile, don't be nervous.

40:27.080 --> 40:28.280
When we get to the office,

40:28.320 --> 40:29.280
just explain calmly.

40:29.320 --> 40:30.160
Ms. He is really kind.

40:30.200 --> 40:31.280
She won't give you a hard time.

40:31.320 --> 40:32.720
If you need me, I can come in with you

40:32.760 --> 40:33.600
and help explain.

40:37.880 --> 40:38.860
No need, Monitor.

40:38.900 --> 40:39.800
I've got this.

40:46.400 --> 40:47.480
Take it up for me.

41:07.580 --> 41:08.660
Words from your classmates.

41:08.700 --> 41:09.620
Does it affect you?

41:11.740 --> 41:12.580
No? Really?

41:17.080 --> 41:18.120
From now on,

41:18.160 --> 41:20.020
try spending more time with the girls.

41:20.060 --> 41:21.660
If you only hang out

41:21.700 --> 41:22.740
with boys,

41:22.780 --> 41:24.320
it's bound to raise eyebrows,

41:24.840 --> 41:27.080
and it doesn't look good either.

41:33.060 --> 41:33.900
Ms. He.

41:35.920 --> 41:37.320
Cai Fangyuan,

41:37.360 --> 41:38.420
Yu Qiao and others.

41:39.600 --> 41:41.120
They are first my best friends,

41:42.020 --> 41:43.380
then male classmates.

41:43.420 --> 41:45.240
I don't think I've done anything wrong,

41:46.500 --> 41:48.360
so I don't care how others see me.

41:49.960 --> 41:51.380
But they are my close friends.

41:52.500 --> 41:53.740
I have no reason to

41:54.340 --> 41:55.280
distance myself from them.

41:57.800 --> 41:59.760
Right now, your top priority

41:59.800 --> 42:01.300
is to focus on studys.

42:02.720 --> 42:04.860
Staying in Class 18
at Jialin Experimental isn't easy.

42:05.420 --> 42:08.000
If you keep ranking low
in the monthly exams,

42:08.040 --> 42:09.200
you'll get kicked out

42:09.240 --> 42:10.980
by next semester.

42:12.960 --> 42:14.280
Making good friends

42:15.440 --> 42:17.140
doesn't go against my principles

42:18.240 --> 42:19.100
or

42:20.140 --> 42:21.660
against school rules.

42:23.900 --> 42:24.780
But if

42:25.560 --> 42:27.880
poor grades mean
getting removed out of Class 18,

42:27.920 --> 42:29.140
if that is the policy…

42:31.160 --> 42:32.120
I'll follow.

42:33.480 --> 42:34.640
I'll study hard

42:35.780 --> 42:37.540
to stay in the class.

42:37.580 --> 42:38.920
Facing challenges

42:39.740 --> 42:41.180
isn't about empty slogans,

42:41.220 --> 42:42.180
it takes real work.

42:42.840 --> 42:44.740
Since you're within the bottom 15th
of the class,

42:44.780 --> 42:45.800
we'll have a half-day

42:45.840 --> 42:46.860
tutoring on Saturdays.

42:48.120 --> 42:48.960
Better make it count.

45:10.660 --> 45:13.620
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
